# Stale autoconf output from an out-of-tree XPM build. This repo has no
# configure and no script reads these, so there is nothing to regenerate them
# from - they are leftovers from cxpm/sxpm and safe to delete at any time.
# Makefile stays bare so it also covers the per-directory ones.
